OL,3,AManhunt after shooting at Swiss rave
OL,4,Akills woman, 22, and injures five
OL,5,
OL,6,FA manhunt is under way after a
OL,7,F22-year-old woman was killed and five
OL,8,Fothers injured in a shooting at a rave
OL,9,Fin Switzerland.
OL,11,FThe woman died at the scene in Aarau,
OL,12,Fpolice said. Those injured were four
OL,13,Fmen and a woman aged between 24 and 27,
OL,14,Fall of whom are in hospital with
OL,15,Finjuries "ranging from minor to
OL,16,Fsevere".
OL,18,FOrganisers and performers confirmed the
OL,19,Fshooting happened at a techno rave
OL,20,Fbeing held at a horse racing track in
OL,21,Fthe town, which is located some 46km
OL,22,F(29 miles) west of Zurich.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
